# Parameters for the LOVE20Hub module.
#
# The Hub takes one injected dependency (STAKE_ADDRESS, which lives in addresses.core.params) and derives
# Router / Factory / Launch / MemberNFT / WrappedNative from it. The DEX fee profile is not a Hub input
# either: Stake stores it (it needs the same two ratios to predict the pair's `_mintFee`) and the Hub
# copies it at construction. There is therefore nothing left to configure here - the profile lives in
# core.params, next to the Stake that owns it.
#
# Reference profiles, for choosing what to put in core.params (not used by this network):
#
#   Uniswap V2 (local dex)  3000000000000000 / 0               (0.30% total, feeTo permanently zero)
#   Uniswap V2 with feeTo   2500000000000000 / 500000000000000 (0.30% total, 1/6 of sqrt(k) growth)
#   PancakeSwap mainnet     1700000000000000 / 800000000000000 (0.25% total: 0.17% LP + 0.08% protocol)
#   PancakeSwap testnet     1500000000000000 / 500000000000000 (0.20% total: 0.15% LP + 0.05% protocol)
#
# The local `dex` repository charges 0.30% and its Factory is deployed with `feeToSetter = address(0)`, so
# `feeTo` can never be set and no protocol fee is ever minted.

# Optional cross-check: a token that forms a funded pair with the wrapped native token. The deploy script
# inverts one real `getAmountsOut` quote against this pair and aborts when the recovered swap fee disagrees
# with the profile Stake reports. Left empty on the local chain because the Hub may be deployed before any
# pool has liquidity; 21_check_hub.sh re-runs the same check when a pair is available.
SWAP_FEE_PROBE_TOKEN=
